reaction "乙醛加氢还原"
equation "CH₃CHO + H₂ → CH₃CH₂OH"
summary "醛羰基加氢还原为伯醇。"

step "乙醛与氢气" {
  note "羰基C具有亲电性，氢化催化剂活化H₂。"
  atom C1 C
  atom C2 C
  atom O3 O
  atom H4 H
  atom H5 H
  atom H1a H
  atom H1b H
  atom H1c H
  atom H2a H
  bond C1 C2 1
  bond C2 O3 2
  bond H4 H5 1
  bond C1 H1a 1
  bond C1 H1b 1
  bond C1 H1c 1
  bond C2 H2a 1
}

step "氢加成到羰基" {
  note "一个H加到羰基碳，另一个H加到氧，C=O转化为C-OH。考试重点：醛还原生成伯醇，酮还原生成仲醇。"
  atom C1 C
  atom C2 C
  atom O3 O
  atom H1a H
  atom H1b H
  atom H1c H
  atom H2a H
  atom H2b H
  atom H3a H
  bond C1 C2 1
  bond C2 O3 1
  bond C1 H1a 1
  bond C1 H1b 1
  bond C1 H1c 1
  bond C2 H2a 1
  bond C2 H2b 1
  bond O3 H3a 1
}
